codex
The proof needed one semantic refinement: list iteration must remain visible as K transitions so the prover can induct on a symbolic list. I’ve made that change without specializing the data—the iterator still evaluates the translated generator, predicate, and element expressions—and the concrete behavior is unchanged. The symbolic proof is running now.
